# Joy PeopleHR Multi-Tenant HRMS SaaS — Core Architecture & End-to-End Workflow Plan

## Executive Architecture Summary

Joy PeopleHR is structured into four clearly decoupled, highly scalable tiers:
1. **SaaS Platform Plane (Super Admin)**: Global tenant management, subscription licensing, organization provisioning, and customer lifecycle governance.
2. **Tenant Control Plane (Company Admin)**: Tenant-isolated company configuration, dynamic department/designation trees, custom role & permission builder (PBAC), policy governance, and HR delegation.
3. **Operational HR & People Engine (HR & Managers)**: Employee onboarding, workforce directory, biometric/GPS attendance, shift rosters, statutory payroll, leave ledgers, and document vaults.
4. **Unified Workforce Identity & Self-Service (Employees)**: Single unified identity across Web and Mobile apps, personal attendance clocking, leave requests, payslips, e-Sign, and hierarchical approvals.

